25. Bootstrap Forms
Form — foydalanuvchidan ma'lumot olish uchun ishlatiladi.
Email → Password → Remember me → Submit
1. Bootstrap Default Settings
Text input, textarea va select uchun:

<input type="text" class="form-control">
<textarea class="form-control"></textarea>
<select class="form-control">
    <option>Uzbekistan</option>
    <option>USA</option>
</select>
.form-control → inputni Bootstrap style bilan chiqaradi va odatda 100% kenglik beradi.
2. Vertical Form
<form>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email:</label>
        <input type="email"
               class="form-control"
               id="email"
               placeholder="Enter email">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="password">Password:</label>
        <input type="password"
               class="form-control"
               id="password"
               placeholder="Enter password">
    </div>

    <div class="checkbox">
        <label>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Remember me
        </label>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-default">
        Submit
    </button>

</form>
//KEYWORD 
.form-group → label + input guruhini tartiblaydi
.form-control → input style
.checkbox → checkbox
.btn → button
3. Inline Form

Bunda form elementlari bir qatorda joylashadi.
<form class="form-inline">

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email:</label>
        <input type="email"
               class="form-control"
               id="email">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="password">Password:</label>
        <input type="password"
               class="form-control"
               id="password">
    </div>

    <div class="checkbox">
        <label>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Remember me
        </label>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-default">
        Submit
    </button>

</form>
.form-inline → formni bir qatorga joylashtiradi.
⚠️ Bootstrap 3 da inline ko‘rinish 768px va undan katta ekranlarda qo‘llanadi.

5. Horizontal Form
Bunda label va input yonma-yon turadi.

//KEYWORD
.form-horizontal → horizontal form
.control-label → labelni moslashtiradi
.col-sm-2 → labelga 2/12 joy
.col-sm-10 → inputga 10/12 joy
.col-sm-offset-2 → 2/12 joyni tashlab ketadi
//KEYWORD
→ Foydalanuvchidan ma'lumot olish uchun form yaratadi.

.form-control → input/textarea/select style
.form-group → label + input guruhini tartiblaydi

Vertical → default form
.form-inline → elementlar bir qatorda
.form-horizontal → label va input yonma-yon
.control-label → horizontal label
.checkbox → checkbox
.sr-only → labelni ekranda yashiradi

.col-sm-2 → 2/12
.col-sm-10 → 10/12
.col-sm-offset-2 → 2/12 joy tashlab ketadi

